<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Isis cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Isis cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Peter Drake said he downgraded Isis Pharmaceuticals to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drug company were off 1/8 to 19-7/8.</p>
<p>--Drake said he made the move based on price.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
